      <Docs>
        <summary>Called when the HID device has been closed or disconnected.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Called when the HID device has been closed or disconnected.</para>
          <para>This is the definitive signal that the device session has ended. All registered listeners (including this instance) are automatically unregistered, and the device is no longer usable.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/hid/HidEventListener#onDisconnected()" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.hid.HidEventListener.onDisconnected</code>.</a></format></para>
