        <param name="cause">The exception describing the error.</param>
        <summary>Called when an error occurs during HID input report processing.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Called when an error occurs during HID input report processing.</para>
          <para>This callback is purely informative and never unregisters listeners. On non-fatal errors, report processing continues. On fatal errors, this callback is immediately followed by an explicit onDisconnected() invocation.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/hid/HidEventListener#onError(java.lang.Exception)" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.hid.HidEventListener.onError</code>.</a></format></para>
